:\\\"Current evidence retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Served from the bundled demo snapshot: Likely pathogenic, 10 submissions, reviewed by expert panel.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Classification difference detected\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance. Current interpretation normalised to Likely pathogenic. The interpretation crossed into the clinically actionable band, so records carrying it may need review.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional sources compared\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional index asserts Likely pathogenic, consistent with the global reading.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Impacted records identified\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"12,482 findings checked; 4 carry this variant.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Evidence brief generated\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Composed from the structured fields of the cited records above.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Human review requested\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"VariantPulse does not change any record. A clinician decides what happens next.\\\"}],\\\"caseId\\\":\\\"VP-R-2026-001\\\"},{\\\"variant\\\":{\\\"key\\\":\\\"BRCA2:c.7847C\\u003eT\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"BRCA2\\\",\\\"hgvsCoding\\\":\\\"c.7847C\\u003eT\\\",\\\"proteinChange\\\":\\\"p.Ser2616Phe\\\",\\\"clinvarId\\\":\\\"630829\\\",\\\"recordedClassification\\\":\\\"VUS\\\",\\\"recordedOn\\\":\\\"2023-06-19\\\",\\\"recordedEvidenceNote\\\":\\\"Missense change in the DNA-binding domain. Classified as uncertain significance; functional data not yet available.\\\",\\\"condition\\\":\\\"Hereditary breast and ovarian cancer\\\",\\\"panel\\\":\\\"Hereditary cancer panel\\\"},\\\"evidence\\\":{\\\"clinvarId\\\":\\\"630829\\\",\\\"accession\\\":\\\"VCV000630829\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"NM_000059.4(BRCA2):c.7847C\\u003eT (p.Ser2616Phe)\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"BRCA2\\\",\\\"cdnaChange\\\":\\\"c.7847C\\u003eT\\\",\\\"variantType\\\":\\\"single nucleotide variant\\\",\\\"molecularConsequence\\\":\\\"missense variant\\\",\\\"proteinChange\\\":\\\"S2616F\\\",\\\"rsid\\\