ust be resolved by a clinician, not by the software.\\\",\\\"citations\\\":[{\\\"pmid\\\":\\\"22074124\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Molecular basis of β-thalassemia in the United Arab Emirates.\\\",\\\"journal\\\":\\\"Hemoglobin\\\",\\\"year\\\":\\\"2011\\\"},{\\\"pmid\\\":\\\"35330423\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Middle Eastern Genetic Variation Improves Clinical Annotation of the Human Genome.\\\",\\\"journal\\\":\\\"J Pers Med\\\",\\\"year\\\":\\\"2022\\\"}]},\\\"regionalDisagreement\\\":{\\\"conflicting\\\":true,\\\"severity\\\":\\\"high\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"One source places this variant in the clinically actionable band and the other does not.\\\",\\\"globalCode\\\":\\\"VUS\\\",\\\"regionalCode\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\"},\\\"impactedPatients\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"VP-10728\\\",\\\"ageBand\\\":\\\"25-34\\\",\\\"sex\\\":\\\"Female\\\",\\\"variantKey\\\":\\\"HBB:c.380T\\u003eG\\\",\\\"testedOn\\\":\\\"2023-01-30\\\",\\\"reportingLab\\\":\\\"Molecular Pathology Unit\\\",\\\"orderingDepartment\\\":\\\"Haematology\\\",\\\"clinicalOwner\\\":\\\"Dr. F. Al Mazrouei\\\",\\\"lastContact\\\":\\\"2023-02-22\\\",\\\"reviewState\\\":\\\"Not reviewed\\\",\\\"indication\\\":\\\"Premarital screening follow-up\\\"}],\\\"impactedRecordCount\\\":1,\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"level\\\":\\\"HIGH\\\",\\\"score\\\":90,\\\"factors\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Moved out of the actionable band\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Pathogenic to Uncertain significance. Earlier guidance may no longer apply.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":45},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional evidence conflicts\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional and global sources reach different conclusions.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":30},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"1 record on file\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Historical results carrying this variant that a reviewer would reassess.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":5},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"High review confidence\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"The current classification carries expert-panel or guideline review.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":10}]},\\\"requiresReview\\\":true,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Global and regional evidence disagree on HBB c.380T\\u003eG. The global consensus is uncertain significance, drawn from 9 submissions. The regional index asserts pathogenic on 0 observations across a cohort of 2,884. One source places this variant in the clinically actionable band and the other does not, which is the form of disagreement most likely to change a care decision. One record on file carries this variant and has not yet been reassessed.\\\",\\\"pipeline\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Historical record retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"HBB c.380T\\u003eG reported as Pathogenic on 2023-01-30.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Variant normalised\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Resolved to ClinVar VCV000015483 (rs33925391) and keyed as HBB:c.380T\\u003eG.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Current evidence retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Served from the bundled demo snapshot: Uncertain significance, 9 submissions, reviewed by expert panel.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Classification difference detected\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Pathogenic. Current interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance. The interpretation left the clinically actionable band, so earlier management guidance may no longer apply.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional sources compared\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional index asserts Pathogenic across 0 observations. One source places this variant in the clinically actionable band and the other does not.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Impacted records identified\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"12,482 findings checked; 1 carries this variant.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Evidence brief generated\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Composed from the structured fields of the cited records above.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Human review requested\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"VariantPulse does not change any record. A clinician decides what happens next.\\\"}],\\\"caseId\\\":\\\"VP-R-2026-002\\\"},{\\\"variant\\\":{\\\"key\\\":\\\"BRCA2:c.9538C\\u003eT\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"BRCA2\\\",\\\"hgvsCoding\