d\\\",\\\"indication\\\":\\\"Premarital screening follow-up\\\"}],\\\"impactedRecordCount\\\":1,\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"level\\\":\\\"MEDIUM\\\",\\\"score\\\":45,\\\"factors\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional evidence conflicts\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional and global sources reach different conclusions.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":30},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"1 record on file\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Historical results carrying this variant that a reviewer would reassess.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":5},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"High review confidence\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"The current classification carries expert-panel or guideline review.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":10}]},\\\"requiresReview\\\":true,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Global and regional evidence disagree on CFTR c.601G\\u003eA. The global consensus is uncertain significance, drawn from 21 submissions. The regional index asserts likely benign on 4 observations across a cohort of 3,030. One record on file carries this variant and has not yet been reassessed.\\\",\\\"pipeline\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Historical record retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"CFTR c.601G\\u003eA reported as Uncertain significance on 2023-05-02.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Variant normalised\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Resolved to ClinVar VCV000054022 (rs138338446) and keyed as CFTR:c.601G\\u003eA.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Current evidence retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Served from the bundled demo snapshot: Uncertain significance, 21 submissions, reviewed by expert panel.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Classification difference detected\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance. Current interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance. Codes are identical, so no reclassification has occurred.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional sources compared\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional index asserts Likely benign across 4 observations. The sources place this variant in different bands without crossing the actionable boundary.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Impacted records 