41868\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Standards and guidelines for the interpretation of sequence variants: a joint consensus recommendation of the American College of Medical Genetics and Genomics and the Association for Molecular Pathology.\\\",\\\"journal\\\":\\\"Genet Med\\\",\\\"year\\\":\\\"2015\\\"}]},\\\"recordedCode\\\":\\\"CONFLICTING\\\",\\\"currentCode\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"CLASSIFICATION_DRIFT\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":[\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Conflicting classifications.\\\",\\\"Current interpretation normalised to Pathogenic.\\\",\\\"The interpretation crossed into the clinically actionable band, so records carrying it may need review.\\\"]},\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"CLASSIFICATION_DRIFT\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":{\\\"stars\\\":2,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Multiple submitters, no conflicts\\\",\\\"strength\\\":\\\"Moderate\\\"},\\\"regional\\\":{\\\"variantKey\\\":\\\"HBB:c.364G\\u003eC\\\",\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"observations\\\":11,\\\"cohortSize\\\":3031,\\\"regionalFrequency\\\":0.0018146,\\\"globalFrequency\\\":0.0004442,\\\"contributingCentres\\\":[\\\"CTGA, Centre for Arab Genomic Studies (UAE records)\\\"],\\\"lastUpdated\\\":\\\"2026-09-25\\\",\\\"note\\\":\\\"Haemoglobin D-Punjab. CTGA records it in UAE patients as likely pathogenic / pathogenic for sickle cell disease and beta-thalassaemia, and it is about four times more frequent in gnomAD's Middle Eastern group than globally. Global ClinVar submitters were still in conflict in January 2023 and only converged on pathogenic / likely pathogenic in March 2026: regional evidence was ahead of the global record.\\\",\\\"citations\\\":[{\\\"pmid\\\":\\\"22074124\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Molecular basis of β-thalassemia in the United Arab Emirates.\\\",\\\"journal\\\":\\\"Hemoglobin\\\",\\\"year\\\":\\\"2011\\\"}]},\\\"regionalDisagreement\\\":{\\\"conflicting\\\":false,\\\"severity\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Both sources place this variant in the same band.\\\",\\\"globalCode\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"regionalCode\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\"},\\\"impactedPatients\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"VP-10701\\\",\\\"ageBand\\\":\\\"25-34\\\",\\\"sex\\\":\\\"Female\\\",\\\"variantKey\\\":\\\"HBB:c.364G\\u003eC\\\",\\\"testedOn\\\":\\\"2023-02-14\\\",\\\"reportingLab\\\":\\\"Molecular Pathology Unit\\\",\\\"orderingDepartment\\\":\\\"Haematology\\\",\\\"clinicalOwner\\\":\\\"Dr. F. Al Mazrouei\\\",\\\"lastContact\\\":\\\"2023-03-07\\\",\\\"reviewState\\\":\\\"Not reviewed\\\",\\\"indication\\\":\\\"Premarital screening follow-up\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"VP-10738\\\",\\\"ageBand\\\":\\\"5-11\\\",\\\"sex\\\":\\\"Male\\\",\\\"variantKey\\\":\\\"HBB:c.364G\\u003eC\\\",\\\"testedOn\\\":\\\"2023-06-05\\\",\\\"reportingLab\\\":\\\"Molecular Pathology Unit\\\",\\\"orderingDepartment\\\":\\\"Haematology\\\",\\\"clinicalOwner\\\":\\\"Dr. F. Al Mazrouei\\\",\\\"lastContact\\\":\\\"2024-01-22\\\",\\\"reviewState\\\":\\\"Not reviewed\\\",\\\"indication\\\":\\\"Anaemia work-up\\\"}],\\\"impactedRecordCount\\\":2,\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"level\\\":\\\"HIGH\\\",\\\"score\\\":70,\\\"factors\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Moved into the actionable band\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Conflicting classifications to Pathogenic.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":60},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"2 records on file\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Historical results carrying this variant that a reviewer would reassess.\\\",\\\"weight\\\":10}]},\\\"requiresReview\\\":true,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Since the 2023 report, the consensus for HBB c.364G\\u003eC has moved from conflicting classifications to pathogenic. That reading rests on 23 submissions at moderate review confidence, multiple submitters, no conflicts. That crosses the clinically actionable boundary, so management guidance issued on the original interpretation may no longer be the right guidance. 2 records on file carry this variant and have not yet been reassessed.\\\",\\\"pipeline\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Historical record retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"HBB c.364G\\u003eC reported as Conflicting classifications on 2023-02-14.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Variant normalised\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Resolved to ClinVar VCV000015152 (rs33946267) and keyed as HBB:c.364G\\u003eC.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Current evidence retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Served from the bundled demo snapshot: Pathogenic/Likely pathogenic, 23 submissions, criteria provided, multiple submitters, no conflicts.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Classification difference detected\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Conflicting classifications. Current interpretation normalised to Pathogenic. The interpretation crossed into the clinically actionable band, so records carrying it may need review.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional sources compared\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional index asserts Pathogenic, consistent with the global reading.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Impacted records identified\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"12,482 findings checked; 2 carry this variant.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Evidence brief generated\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Composed from the structured fields of the cited records above.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Human review requested\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"VariantPulse does not change any record. A clinician decides what happens next.\\\"}],\\\"caseId\\\":\\\"VP-R-2026-007\\\"},{\\\"variant\\\":{\\\"key\\\":\\\"MYBPC3:c.776delinsTT\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"MYBPC3\\\",\\\"hgvsCoding\\\":\\\"c.776delinsTT\\\",\\\"proteinChange\\\":\\\"p.Ala259fs\\\",\\\"clinvarId\\\":\\\"4689837\\\",\\\"recordedClassification\\\":\\\"VUS\\\",\\\"recordedOn\\\":\\\"2023-03-20\\\",\\\"recordedEvidenceNote\\\":\\\"Novel frameshift change with no public submissions at the time of reporting. Classified as uncertain pending further evidence.\\\",\\\"condition\\\":\\\"Left ventricular non-compaction / cardiomyopathy\\\",\\\"panel\\\":\\\"Inherited cardiac conditions panel\\\"},\\\"evidence\\\":{\\\"clinvarId\\\":\\\"4689837\\\",\\\"accession\\\":\\\"VCV004689837\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"NM_000256.3(MYBPC3):c.776delinsTT (p.Ala259fs)\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"MYBPC3\\\",\\\"cdnaChange\\\":\\\"c.776delinsTT\\\",\\\"variantType\\\":\\\"Indel\\\",\\\"molecularConsequence\\\":\\\"frameshift variant\\\",\\\"proteinChange\\\":\\\"A259fs\\\",\\\"rsid\\\":null,\\\"classification\\\":\\\"Likely pathogenic\\\",\\\"reviewStatus\\\":\\\"criteria provided, single submitter\\\",\\\"lastEvaluated\\\":\\\"2025-07-31\\\",\\\"fdaRecognised\\\":false,\\\"submissionCount\\\":1,\\\"conditions\\\":[],\\\"location\\\":{\\\"assembly\\\":\\\"GRCh38\\\",\\\"chr\\\":\\\"11\\\",\\\"band\\\":\\\"11p11.2\\\",\\\"start\\\":\\\"47347902\\\",\\\"stop\\\":\\\"47347902\\\"},\\\"peakAlleleFrequency\\\":null,\\\"citations\\\":[]},\\\"recordedCode\\\":\\\"VUS\\\",\\\"currentCode\\\":\\\"LIKELY_PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"CLASSIFICATION_DRIFT\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"toward-pathogenic\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":[\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance.\\\",\\\"Current interpretation normalised to Likely pathogenic.\\\",\\\"The interpretation crossed into the clinically actionable band, so records carrying it may need review.\\\"]},\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"CLASSIFICATION_DRIFT\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":{\\\"stars\\\":1,\\\"label\\\":\\\"Single submitter\\\",\\\"strength\\\":\\\"Limited\\\"},\\\"regional\\\":{\\\"variantKey\\\":\\\"MYBPC3:c.776delinsTT\\\",\\\"assertion\\\":\\\"LIKELY_PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"observations\\\":0,\\\"cohortSize\\\":3042,\\\"regionalFrequency\\\":0,\\\"globalFrequency\\\":0,\\\"contributingCentres\\\":[\\\"CTGA, Centre for Arab Genomic Studies (UAE records)\\\"],\\\"lastUpdated\\\":\\\"2026-09-25\\\",\\\"note\\\":\\\"CTGA lists this frameshift in a UAE patient as likely pathogenic for left ventricular non-compaction (record dated 2020). It did not appear in ClinVar until after January 2023 (first classified likely pathogenic, July 2025, single submitter). Another case where a regional