hogenic. That reading rests on a single submission at limited review confidence, single submitter. That crosses the clinically actionable boundary, so management guidance issued on the original interpretation may no longer be the right guidance. 2 records on file carry this variant and have not yet been reassessed.\\\",\\\"pipeline\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Historical record retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"MYBPC3 c.776delinsTT reported as Uncertain significance on 2023-03-20.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Variant normalised\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Resolved to ClinVar VCV004689837 and keyed as MYBPC3:c.776delinsTT.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Current evidence retrieved\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Served from the bundled demo snapshot: Likely pathogenic, 1 submission, criteria provided, single submitter.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Classification difference detected\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Recorded interpretation normalised to Uncertain significance. Current interpretation normalised to Likely pathogenic. The interpretation crossed into the clinically actionable band, so records carrying it may need review.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Regional sources compared\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Regional index asserts Likely pathogenic, consistent with the global reading.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Impacted records identified\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"12,482 findings checked; 2 carry this variant.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Evidence brief generated\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"Composed from the structured fields of the cited records above.\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Human review requested\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"VariantPulse does not change any record. A clinician decides what happens next.\\\"}],\\\"caseId\\\":\\\"VP-R-2026-009\\\"},{\\\"variant\\\":{\\\"key\\\":\\\"BRCA1:c.1140dup\\\",\\\"gene\\\":\\\"BRCA1\\\",\\\"hgvsCoding\\\":\\\"c.1140dup\\\",\\\"proteinChange\\\":\\\"p.Lys381fs\\\",\\\"clinvarId\\\":\\\"231732\\\",\\\"recordedClassification\\\":\\\"PATHOGENIC\\\",\\\"recordedOn\\\":\\\"2022-10-03\\\",\\\"recordedEvid